data: {"id": "ab06208890d6497a-thinking-parallel_evidence-2288", "run_id": "ab06208890d6497a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，现在我已经完成了所有可行的诊断数据采集。以下是本轮调查的总结：\n\n---\n\n## 实体身份与生命周期确认\n\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4`\n- **UID/Labels**: `aiops.lab/case-id=c02`，由 ReplicaSet `workload-65b7f54794` 控制\n- **Phase**: `Pending`，**未进入 Running 状态**\n- **Node**: `node2/10.2.0.50`\n- **容器状态**: 容器 `app` 始终处于 `ImagePullBackOff`，Restart Count=0，从未启动过\n\n## 已采集事实（支持/确认候选原因）\n\n1. **ImagePullFailed 原因确认为 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`**：\n   - Pod YAML 显示 `image=registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`，且 `imagePull", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788415018732, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

