data: {"id": "ab06208890d6497a-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "ab06208890d6497a", "seq": 2289, "ts_ms": 1788415026264, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 63.172, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/ab06208890d6497a-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "affaa337f9d7bb4bef21b32a3ffe94a4ac81b955cc6a17531c3ca70b16fe33dc", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "7220ca7e5f4477e61b825d0e36c86ce6c25631c1ee3fcb49b730b3047c3f8421"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "ab06208890d6497a-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "ab06208890d6497a", "seq": 2290, "ts_ms": 1788415026265, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "ab06208890d6497a-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "ab06208890d6497a", "seq": 2291, "ts_ms": 1788415034941, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.676, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1547, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4 in aiops-case-02 stuck in ImagePullBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason`: ImagePullBackOff, `message`: Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\" (fact-961e15bff5dc, fact-6948839ea859) | 确定 Pod 处于等待状态的根本原因是镜像拉取失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `reason`: BackOff, `message`: Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\", `count`: x349 over 84m (fact-559cb5c72975) | 证明镜像拉取失败是长期持续存在的系统性现象，而非短暂网络抖动 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `reason`: ImagePullBackOff, `value`: 1 (fact-be4adc202d65) | 指标状态与 Kubernetes 事件描述一致，独立确认了当前异常状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container`: app, `reason`: ImagePullBackOff, `message`: Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\" (fact-6948839ea859) | 直接定位到容器配置中无效的镜像引用路径及标签 |\n\n现有 K8s 状态、指标和事件日志相互印证，一致指向 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 这一无效镜像源是导致故障的直接原因。由于容器尚未启动，Logging 和 Tracing 维度的数据采集被跳过，但 K8s 侧的多维度事实已充分支持根因定位。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n无效的镜像配置 (registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing) → 镜像拉取长期失败 (x349次/84分钟) → Pod 处于 ImagePullBackOff (Pending) 状态 → 用户服务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 Pod 规范中配置了无效的镜像引用 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`。该镜像地址属于保留域名且不可达，导致 kubelet 在长达 84 分钟的周期内连续 349 次拉取失败（证据编号：1, 2, 4）。受限于 K8s 调度机制，Pod 无法启动（证据编号：4），从而引发持续的 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（证据编号：1, 3）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4 in aiops-case-02 stuck in ImagePullBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `reason`: ImagePullBackOff, `message`: Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\" (fact-961e15bff5dc, fact-6948839ea859) | 确定 Pod 处于等待状态的根本原因是镜像拉取失败 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `reason`: BackOff, `message`: Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\", `count`: x349 over 84m (fact-559cb5c72975) | 证明镜像拉取失败是长期持续存在的系统性现象，而非短暂网络抖动 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `reason`: ImagePullBackOff, `value`: 1 (fact-be4adc202d65) | 指标状态与 Kubernetes 事件描述一致，独立确认了当前异常状态 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container`: app, `reason`: ImagePullBackOff, `message`: Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\" (fact-6948839ea859) | 直接定位到容器配置中无效的镜像引用路径及标签 |\n\n现有 K8s 状态、指标和事件日志相互印证，一致指向 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 这一无效镜像源是导致故障的直接原因。由于容器尚未启动，Logging 和 Tracing 维度的数据采集被跳过，但 K8s 侧的多维度事实已充分支持根因定位。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n无效的镜像配置 (registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing) → 镜像拉取长期失败 (x349次/84分钟) → Pod 处于 ImagePullBackOff (Pending) 状态 → 用户服务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 Pod 规范中配置了无效的镜像引用 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`。该镜像地址属于保留域名且不可达，导致 kubelet 在长达 84 分钟的周期内连续 349 次拉取失败（证据编号：1, 2, 4）。受限于 K8s 调度机制，Pod 无法启动（证据编号：4），从而引发持续的 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（证据编号：1, 3）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

